---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-950 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle editorial grid overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 editorial-grid pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-blue-300 uppercase tracking-widest bg-blue-950/60 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-blue-800/80">
        Próximo Fechamento
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
        Feche a próxima competência sem estresse e sem mensagens soltas.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal">
        Cadastre suas primeiras empresas em minutos, abra a competência e veja os documentos chegarem organizados no painel. Teste livremente por 14 dias.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://app.competa.com.br"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-950 active:scale-[0.99]"
        >
          <span>Começar teste gratuito de 14 dias</span>
          <svg class="size-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://app.competa.com.br"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 px-6 py-4 text-base font-medium text-slate-200 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-800 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
        >
          Já possui conta? Entrar
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-y-2 gap-x-8 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
        <span>✓ Sem cartão de crédito</span>
        <span>✓ Ativação imediata</span>
        <span>✓ Cancelamento a qualquer momento</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
